Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.23,0:03:30.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs24}上面飞的有小天使 大耳鼠(又译 外星小叮叮)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.15,0:03:49.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等 等等 等等啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.01,0:03:59.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家好 我是哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.40,0:04:03.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,24年里(1980-2003) 我们经历了无数的冒险
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.90,0:04:07.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这全是托了大家的福
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.09,0:04:18.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后 现在是25周年特别纪念电影
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.12,0:04:21.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从以前开始不管发生什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.61,0:04:26.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都一直在你身旁
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.97,0:04:29.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 现在由我正式为大家...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.12,0:04:32.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 老鼠啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.94,0:06:48.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上就能见到了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.81,0:07:21.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.22,0:08:41.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接好了 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.63,0:08:49.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.12,0:08:52.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 这不是叫你练习不接住球啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.65,0:08:57.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要好好找回来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.72,0:09:00.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了啦 真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.01,0:09:04.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们先回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.87,0:09:07.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么这样...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.38,0:09:09.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是因为你没接到球呀
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.89,0:09:12.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是 再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.75,0:09:16.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回家啦 回家啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.23,0:09:19.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 对了 你要小心蛇喔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.50,0:09:23.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.91,0:09:31.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.07,0:09:43.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好深
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.95,0:09:44.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会游泳吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.04,0:09:47.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会游泳的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.28,0:09:56.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在哪 哪儿 哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.12,0:09:57.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.63,0:10:00.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.13,0:10:06.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快停下 好痒呀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.35,0:10:13.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那 明天见喔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.30,0:10:17.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没办法呀 小咪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.99,0:10:20.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看 是哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.79,0:10:23.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在约会吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.45,0:10:27.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧 发条老鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.50,0:10:31.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有我在 大雄什么也做不好的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.49,0:10:33.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.97,0:10:38.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.09,0:10:44.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀 老鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.84,0:10:52.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 不要跟着我 不行的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.83,0:10:55.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈绝对不会同意的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.29,0:10:59.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.83,0:11:09.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.82,0:11:15.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.93,0:12:34.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 小狗啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.64,0:12:37.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 老鼠啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.52,0:12:38.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.44,0:12:39.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.63,0:12:44.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这小狗是怎么回事 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.36,0:12:49.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.76,0:12:52.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁妈妈还没发觉的时候 放到房间去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.59,0:12:54.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.98,0:12:56.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.37,0:12:57.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄也在吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.77,0:12:59.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.18,0:13:02.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乖一点
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.93,0:13:08.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次被发现的是距今3亿年前的遗址
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.64,0:13:11.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怀疑是在人类甚至在恐龙诞生以前
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.45,0:13:13.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被判断为具有很高的文明
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.76,0:13:18.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在经过许多考古学家和文人的研究后
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.81,0:13:21.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在已经受到了世界各国的注视
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.81,0:13:22.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来的新闻...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.81,0:13:24.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.36,0:13:25.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.05,0:13:28.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们俩的点心在冰箱里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.01,0:13:29.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 多谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.29,0:13:36.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫什么名字好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.35,0:13:38.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是呀
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.64,0:13:39.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.85,0:13:47.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了 「汪」在英语是[一]的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.85,0:13:47.48,*Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,注：「汪」跟英语的「ONE」发音相近
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.48,0:13:48.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就叫小一怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.37,0:13:52.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 嗯 不错嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.06,0:13:52.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.05,0:13:55.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喜欢吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.85,0:14:00.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,问题是能瞒着妈妈多久
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.46,0:14:03.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『挂壁式狗窝』
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.13,0:14:06.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之 只好先把他养在这
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.91,0:14:09.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就放在这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.84,0:14:11.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.30,0:14:12.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.39,0:14:13.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不错呀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.03,0:14:17.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 这是你的家哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.69,0:14:21.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要乖啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.34,0:14:27.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么可爱 怎么会被丢弃的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.28,0:14:42.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎光临
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.18,0:14:44.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,买什么好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.20,0:14:45.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竹荚鱼怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.29,0:14:49.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竹荚鱼啊 那就要这个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.17,0:14:51.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 谢谢惠顾
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.18,0:14:53.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多给点嘛 大伯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.65,0:14:57.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我家有个人要吃两人份的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.85,0:14:59.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多给点啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.23,0:15:02.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没办法 就送你一条吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.22,0:15:09.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞什么 这些混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.62,0:15:16.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋 真是群无法无天的猫
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.07,0:15:38.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 是小一啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.55,0:15:43.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安 小一
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.88,0:15:49.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.84,0:15:50.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.23,0:15:54.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.24,0:15:56.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你叫小一啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.41,0:16:00.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 过来打个招呼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.22,0:16:03.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.04,0:16:07.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香将来要当我新娘的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.78,0:16:08.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.70,0:16:09.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.71,0:16:12.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 她是静香
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.53,0:16:14.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请多多关照
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.42,0:16:17.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 好聪明呀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.76,0:16:21.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是所谓「物似主人形」
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.63,0:16:27.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讨厌啦 也不用这么大反应吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.31,0:16:37.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你居然会主动做功课啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.67,0:16:42.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们真好 不用做功课
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.53,0:16:49.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 那是...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.62,0:16:51.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个剑玉果然是...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.21,0:16:53.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.12,0:16:57.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是大雄 写成大狗了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.45,0:17:01.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 这是我小时候 奶奶买给我的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.50,0:17:10.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您看
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.53,0:17:11.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.51,0:17:26.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-♪-喂 喂 乌龟先生 乌龟先生哟-♪-
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.40,0:17:32.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-♪-全世界没有比你更慢的了-♪-
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.40,0:17:38.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-♪-没有可以束缚你的东西-♪-
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.30,0:17:43.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-♪-然而你为何如此缓慢-♪-
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.28,0:17:47.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绳子断了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.04,0:17:57.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢小一 谢谢 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.06,0:18:10.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.69,0:18:12.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.05,0:18:14.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 会被妈妈发现的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.55,0:18:17.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁在外面吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.55,0:18:25.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没见过的猫呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.88,0:18:29.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是觉得那只小猫好可怜是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.27,0:18:30.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了 知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.55,0:18:37.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 已经没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.44,0:18:39.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被谁丢了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.46,0:18:51.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来一直过得很辛苦的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.39,0:18:55.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给 你也饿了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.66,0:18:59.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从今天起它就是你的朋友了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.16,0:19:02.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你被雨淋透了 就叫落汤猫吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.00,0:19:07.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样一来 它们的食物成了问题
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.41,0:19:08.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要好好想办法才行
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.29,0:19:14.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.58,0:19:18.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我偶尔经过 发现它们被丢在管子里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.86,0:19:22.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样下去太可怜了 你帮我想想办法吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.69,0:19:29.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 妈妈还在睡午觉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.71,0:19:33.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么为难的时候 哆啦A梦跑到哪里去了呀
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.13,0:19:36.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.83,0:19:38.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听了你们一定吓一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.79,0:19:41.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『免费食物制造机』
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.12,0:19:45.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由水和空气为原材料培养出小球藻
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.51,0:19:49.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以根据猫和狗的喜好 制造出他们喜欢的食物
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.93,0:19:53.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样食物的问题就解决了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.20,0:19:57.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个东西很贵的 可要小心使用哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.37,0:19:59.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 小一
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.77,0:20:05.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就觉得有古怪嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.62,0:20:08.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最近冰箱里的食物经常少了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.64,0:20:10.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.64,0:20:11.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.56,0:20:13.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被发现就不得了了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.37,0:20:15.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『随意门』
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.51,0:20:17.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去远处的深山里
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.01,0:20:20.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快 快
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.69,0:20:24.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.89,0:20:26.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,究竟是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.01,0:20:31.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然有狗的叫声 之前就很可疑了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.58,0:20:33.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.98,0:20:36.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.39,0:20:41.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 新闻有报道过
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.12,0:20:43.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人把不要的猫狗丢在了山里
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.85,0:20:47.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太过分了 但是怎么都跑到这里来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.43,0:21:00.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,土地被开发 改造成别墅
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.83,0:21:03.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那这些小狗们怎么办才好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.11,0:21:07.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『缩微灯』
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.03,0:21:21.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个地方怎么行的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.04,0:21:25.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之在找到好的地方之前先忍耐着
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.50,0:21:27.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家要乖乖的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.98,0:21:39.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 老鼠 讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.63,0:21:42.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.42,0:21:43.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.65,0:21:46.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们在这里做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.83,0:21:49.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.21,0:21:53.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事呀
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.14,0:22:01.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来是这么一回事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.48,0:22:05.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好不容易来到世上却没地方住 太可怜了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.50,0:22:08.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可以随便丢弃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.42,0:22:10.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是呀 是人不好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.68,0:22:13.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.56,0:22:23.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在还没有人类出现的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.29,0:22:28.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把它们带到那遥远的过去就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.22,0:22:36.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有恐龙 没有欺负猫跟狗的动物
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.85,0:22:38.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很遥远的过去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.89,0:22:48.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 就是3亿年前
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.31,0:23:10.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧 小一 这里的全部都是你们的世界哦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.31,0:23:15.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 这里有食物吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.18,0:23:16.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.76,0:23:18.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 过来
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.94,0:23:25.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有这个的话就不用担心了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.77,0:23:29.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好了 小一 使用方法是...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.16,0:23:31.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它又听不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.02,0:23:33.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.64,0:23:35.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.95,0:23:38.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『进化退化光线枪』
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.32,0:23:41.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,调到进化的方向
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.04,0:23:50.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.04,0:23:50.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,438)\fs25}站起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.87,0:23:53.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来比大雄还聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.04,0:23:56.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 听得懂我的话吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.53,0:23:59.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那听好了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.71,0:24:03.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,438)\fs25}小夫 我们到那边去练习棒球吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.34,0:24:03.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先 按这个键
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.96,0:24:04.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,438)\fs25}OK
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.97,0:24:05.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.37,0:24:09.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后按这个红色按纽 明白吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.90,0:24:12.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 你试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.19,0:24:17.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厉害 不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.77,0:24:22.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.64,0:24:24.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.66,0:24:26.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是小一
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.60,0:24:27.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.95,0:24:30.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来来来
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.57,0:24:33.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真顽皮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.82,0:24:38.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-♪-喂 喂 乌龟先生 乌龟先生哟-♪-
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.51,0:24:42.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-♪-全世界没有比你更慢的了-♪-
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.98,0:24:47.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玩得真棒 学得好快呀
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.44,0:24:51.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好 小一 你可是大家的领袖哦
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.83,0:25:10.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做好了 这就是你们的旗帜
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.15,0:25:11.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国旗哦
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.86,0:25:14.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么是漩涡呀
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.05,0:25:16.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是大雄的名字吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.00,0:25:19.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 是野猫野狗的野
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.97,0:25:22.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不都一样嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.11,0:25:23.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是单纯的思维啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.92,0:25:34.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.16,0:25:34.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.77,0:25:38.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 明天会再来的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.22,0:25:40.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家保重
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.49,0:25:45.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们约定好 明天一定会来的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.18,0:25:49.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 快点呀
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.06,0:25:50.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.68,0:26:12.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大... 雄...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.99,0:26:17.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天一定会来的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.66,0:26:25.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真是的 不要随便用我的『后备百宝袋』啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.94,0:26:28.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是道歉了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.46,0:26:30.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家准备好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.29,0:26:31.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.30,0:26:34.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没听到我说吗 你们真是...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.50,0:26:38.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思 你要说教的话到了那再说不迟
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.48,0:26:39.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只好这样了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.08,0:26:41.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.70,0:26:45.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么我就这么宠他呀
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.97,0:26:52.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.38,0:26:56.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时光错转 时光错转
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.61,0:27:02.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 快想想办法呀
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.24,0:27:04.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事呀
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.89,0:27:13.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.09,0:27:17.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟了 忘了按调节键
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.10,0:27:34.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.17,0:27:36.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和昨天不一样的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.36,0:27:37.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.40,0:27:44.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本来设定是3亿年前
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.01,0:27:45.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在却晚了一千年
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.57,0:27:49.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是昨天的千年后的世界啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.85,0:27:51.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是那样
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.61,0:27:54.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 看呀
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.87,0:27:59.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是城市 已经有城市了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.48,0:28:02.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只过了千年就已经...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.37,0:28:06.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和我们住的城市一样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.05,0:28:08.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有谁过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.82,0:28:10.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.59,0:28:12.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个无聊死了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.50,0:28:14.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,娜古对电影太过于讲究了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.57,0:28:17.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧见了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.06,0:28:19.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猫狗穿着人的衣服像人一样在行走
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.87,0:28:22.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且说的是日语
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.19,0:28:23.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是不可思议
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.45,0:28:26.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只过了一千年而已 就进化到了这个程度
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.89,0:28:28.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 难道是因为...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.38,0:28:31.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把『进化退化光线枪』忘在那儿的关系吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.69,0:28:35.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么 那么小一他们...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.62,0:28:38.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,使用了那个 进化成这个样子了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.87,0:28:40.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那小一怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.51,0:28:43.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然已经不在这了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.86,0:28:45.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.49,0:28:49.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天 和他约好一定会来的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.15,0:28:53.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点修好『时光机』 回到千年前吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.30,0:28:57.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有部分零件被卷走了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.81,0:29:00.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们该怎么办呀
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.17,0:29:03.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系 以这个国家的文明程度
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.48,0:29:05.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该可以找到零件的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.46,0:29:06.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.54,0:29:09.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那只要修好了 我们就可以回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.00,0:29:11.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然 所以
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.88,0:29:15.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『猫狗耳饰』
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.08,0:29:18.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用这个就可以变成这个世界的人
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.06,0:29:20.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.09,0:29:21.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 尾巴
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.91,0:29:23.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.82,0:29:26.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看 我变成小猫了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.19,0:29:30.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当然是用猫耳饰了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.48,0:29:32.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是狸猫吗
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.01,0:29:34.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你太失礼了 真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.85,0:29:37.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 大雄你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.64,0:29:39.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,觉得怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.22,0:29:41.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像小一
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.97,0:29:45.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们就去这个世界探险吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.74,0:29:47.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.43,0:29:49.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 快点呀
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.27,0:30:12.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搽了就能快速长毛
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.23,0:30:14.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有生毛水呢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.99,0:30:16.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长成狮子了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.03,0:30:28.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猫杰啦乐园25周年
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.88,0:30:31.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时速300公里游乐车
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.18,0:30:33.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有很多梦般的冒险
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.91,0:30:36.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等着大家哟
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.06,0:30:39.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害呀 真是个大都市
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.41,0:30:40.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.15,0:30:42.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.93,0:30:44.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狗是警察啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.21,0:30:47.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迷路的是小猫啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.17,0:30:50.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说 从刚才开始 我们就好像被当笑话在看
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.76,0:30:53.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比起这个 我肚子可饿了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.17,0:30:54.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.51,0:31:05.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由水和空气生成的小球藻制造的免费食物
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.69,0:31:07.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是说
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.92,0:31:11.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用『免费食物制造机 』作成的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.97,0:31:14.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.55,0:31:16.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,调味不错
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.28,0:31:17.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃呀
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.71,0:31:19.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是被改造过的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.55,0:31:21.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时光错乱是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.96,0:31:27.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是说 在一个时光隧道和另一个缠绕住了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.22,0:31:30.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我们才被卷到了千年后啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.52,0:31:32.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.50,0:32:03.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心...跳...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.04,0:32:11.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真悦耳的歌声
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.11,0:32:16.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小意思 比起我的还差远了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.44,0:32:18.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 你先坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.55,0:32:35.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.02,0:32:39.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 你真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.78,0:32:52.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,山猫轩的歌姬 夏咪
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.45,0:32:57.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪小姐 我叫哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.93,0:33:01.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请叫我哆啦A梦 请收下这个
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.44,0:33:03.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.37,0:33:05.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还是初次见到你这样的猫族
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.53,0:33:09.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猫 你是说我是猫吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.86,0:33:11.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是『七色铃』
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.38,0:33:13.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.66,0:33:16.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有铜锣烧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.06,0:33:18.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦的魔术很有趣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.36,0:33:23.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么说我都是22世纪的猫型机器人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.10,0:33:25.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.79,0:33:29.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪小姐 等等我 我马上就来
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.35,0:33:33.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我呀 夏咪
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.35,0:33:34.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来中毒颇深呢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.68,0:33:41.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪小姐 这个 那个 我...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.79,0:33:45.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我拿走啦
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.31,0:33:46.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.24,0:33:50.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抢别人的东西可是不好的呀
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.02,0:33:51.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快还回来
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.72,0:33:53.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.37,0:33:54.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达古
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.61,0:33:57.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才是你们的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.62,0:33:59.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太郎 那就拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.18,0:34:00.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 快追
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.27,0:34:01.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.90,0:34:03.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.15,0:34:05.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那边 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.90,0:34:10.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.14,0:34:11.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,往那边逃了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.62,0:34:12.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.26,0:34:19.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快还回来
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.49,0:34:21.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达古
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.28,0:34:23.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知子
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.61,0:34:25.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我拿走了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.26,0:34:27.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 我生气了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.92,0:34:30.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『念力眼药水』
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.28,0:34:34.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痲
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.84,0:34:39.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,集中念力
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.87,0:34:46.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.35,0:34:49.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过来这里
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.61,0:34:52.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.66,0:34:54.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 振作点
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.51,0:34:57.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个我拿走啦
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.50,0:34:58.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.43,0:35:00.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.37,0:35:04.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.32,0:35:11.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.51,0:35:18.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可真行呀
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.20,0:35:19.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也是呀
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.74,0:35:36.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然跑的这么快
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.29,0:35:46.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个不是诺雷珠 还给你
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.70,0:35:49.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 你是小一吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.48,0:35:50.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.81,0:35:54.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道你是从哪个地区来的 但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.29,0:35:58.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从生下来就一直叫小八
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.87,0:35:59.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.33,0:36:03.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是呀 大雄 都过了千年了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.89,0:36:05.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一不可能在的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.41,0:36:10.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 夏咪
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.41,0:36:14.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 别管那个啦 我听他们说了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.78,0:36:17.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,438)\fs25}只是个铃铛而已
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.20,0:36:17.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说了什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.83,0:36:25.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说大家都是孤儿啊
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.02,0:36:31.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知子和父母一起去了猫杰啦游乐园玩
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.96,0:36:36.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是只有我们回来了 他们都失踪了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.71,0:36:38.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的爸爸也是
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.57,0:36:41.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太郎的爸爸也是那样
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.66,0:36:45.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知子的父母是数学家
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.24,0:36:47.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达古的爸爸是电脑技术专家
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.57,0:36:52.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有太郎的爸爸 在这里的修理工厂工作的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.58,0:36:55.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这当中一定有什么联系
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.84,0:36:56.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警察说什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.43,0:37:00.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去过了 但他们都偏袒猫杰啦游乐园
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.56,0:37:02.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本不相信我们
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.22,0:37:03.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.76,0:37:08.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么说 猫杰啦游乐园的社长猫杰啦是有钱人
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.21,0:37:11.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一任的总统候选人 很有势力的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.63,0:37:15.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以大家就聚在了一起
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.60,0:37:17.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比起一个人要好
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.39,0:37:20.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家合力一起去查要好得多
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.89,0:37:25.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且我感觉猫杰啦游乐园里隐藏了天大的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.42,0:37:27.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一定要把他找出来
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.21,0:37:29.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有个好东西要给大家看
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.40,0:37:30.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达古
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.16,0:37:33.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要多事
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.45,0:37:36.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.08,0:37:40.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 我们也来帮忙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.95,0:37:44.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对呀 我也正这么想呢
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.08,0:37:46.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 但是
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.08,0:37:50.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 我们是正义的伙伴吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.43,0:37:55.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 大家一起携手干吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.69,0:37:59.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连衣服都买不起还真是让人感动呀
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.36,0:38:02.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连衣服都买不起是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.23,0:38:04.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为 这不是内衣吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.69,0:38:10.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个还是赤裸裸的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.02,0:38:14.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『换衣服照相机』
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.17,0:38:26.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一想到原来在夏咪面前没穿衣服就...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.21,0:38:30.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 真是失礼了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.46,0:38:45.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 这是真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.47,0:38:49.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 那一定要好好注意这只猫
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.47,0:38:52.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.46,0:38:55.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的事在这本黑暗默示录中有记载
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.44,0:38:58.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得到机械构造的猫的话
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.09,0:39:02.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要占领人类世界简直是易如反掌
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.91,0:39:16.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.05,0:39:22.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是小八啊 晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.52,0:39:32.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.07,0:39:43.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.73,0:39:44.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.36,0:39:47.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 不行
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.00,0:39:49.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要推了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.57,0:39:55.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了这个就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.63,0:39:59.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 不可以偷东西
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.32,0:40:01.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是小八
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.76,0:40:03.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八 快还回去
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.54,0:40:07.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不要啰哩啰嗦的说教
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.07,0:40:08.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.78,0:40:11.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.75,0:40:27.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 大家都到哪去了呀
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.85,0:40:29.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是去了猫杰啦游乐园
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.36,0:40:32.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.68,0:40:51.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭喜 25周年
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.55,0:40:53.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝各位有愉快的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.73,0:40:55.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎来到猫杰啦游乐园
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.12,0:40:57.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎欢迎
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.51,0:41:13.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家不是来玩的 不要擅自行动
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.94,0:41:15.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.27,0:41:17.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是猫爪机
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.67,0:41:19.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要玩那个
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.44,0:41:20.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.86,0:41:23.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香 那个怎么样呀
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.32,0:41:24.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,438)\fs25}不错似的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.62,0:41:25.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,438)\fs25}去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.43,0:41:25.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚说就...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.08,0:41:28.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是看起来很好玩的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.84,0:41:30.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.74,0:41:31.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.09,0:41:43.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓到了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.54,0:41:46.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.64,0:42:15.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.56,0:42:16.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家请慢慢下车
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.88,0:42:19.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 你也乐在其中了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.24,0:42:22.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.38,0:42:23.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是小八
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.93,0:42:25.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.78,0:42:27.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诺雷珠呢
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.15,0:42:29.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿到了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.22,0:42:34.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了这个就没问题了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.68,0:42:39.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开动了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.12,0:42:43.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边没错吧 别挖错到运河了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.82,0:42:47.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八 不要担心 我的计算不会错的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.12,0:42:51.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为小八不会游泳啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.47,0:42:55.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是这样的 太郎 拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.39,0:43:08.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猫杰啦游乐园25周年特别节目 有请夏咪小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.65,0:43:17.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.46,0:43:39.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.48,0:43:43.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家往那边逃
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.12,0:43:51.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『发光粉』
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.39,0:43:53.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.32,0:43:54.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.70,0:43:56.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生什么事了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.25,0:43:57.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.51,0:44:01.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么你们会在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.92,0:44:03.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们才是
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.92,0:44:07.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们是来找猫杰啦游乐园的秘密的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.14,0:44:09.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个地下很可疑
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.58,0:44:12.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行了 已经不能用了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.10,0:44:16.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 我们快出去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.99,0:44:19.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.53,0:44:21.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这样空手而回吗
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.73,0:44:22.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.95,0:44:24.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 危险
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.78,0:44:31.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 小八
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.71,0:44:38.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.27,0:44:40.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太郎 达古 知子
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.66,0:44:42.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被封住了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.09,0:44:45.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系的 有哆啦A梦呢
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.18,0:44:50.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么要这么关心我
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.26,0:44:52.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.69,0:44:55.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,438)\fs25}小八 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.80,0:44:58.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我找我找我找我找
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.64,0:45:03.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你们是为了什么来的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.25,0:45:08.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了赴约
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.86,0:45:11.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赴约？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.85,0:45:14.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『地鼠手套』
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.37,0:45:21.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说的小一和我很像吗
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.54,0:45:28.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们没受伤吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.22,0:45:34.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连诺雷珠都不用就...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.83,0:45:36.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诺雷珠是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.67,0:45:38.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们真是什么也不知道呀
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.73,0:45:41.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是让所有的机器启动的能源
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.72,0:45:42.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能源？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.45,0:45:45.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是能量源呀
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.23,0:45:49.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 看来我的能量也没多少了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.75,0:45:51.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎接力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.04,0:45:54.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 交给我吧 开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.94,0:45:58.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快住手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.12,0:46:00.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.41,0:46:09.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大总统 地震是由陨石落下引起的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.88,0:46:11.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去调查伤亡的情况
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.82,0:46:15.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,具体情况还不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.78,0:46:19.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,推测陨石坠落地点是在东北山岳附近
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.40,0:46:23.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直径在20-30米左右
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.92,0:46:26.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 20-30米
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.24,0:46:29.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,区区20-30米左右就能造成那么大的震荡
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.58,0:46:34.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诸位 我们不能再这样继续欺骗民众了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.14,0:46:36.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们该立即把计划发表出去
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.36,0:46:44.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大总统
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.04,0:46:46.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好 猫杰啦先生
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.66,0:46:50.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在只有36个小时了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.68,0:46:54.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要我可以做的 请您尽管说
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.97,0:47:00.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对你平日的相助真是万分感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.17,0:47:06.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对于猫狗国这是我应该做的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.97,0:47:26.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猫杰啦阁下 差不多是时候了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.02,0:47:58.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说不定这个是...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.36,0:48:03.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.04,0:48:04.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.79,0:48:08.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.25,0:48:10.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.17,0:48:16.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八的妈妈是猫？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.69,0:48:18.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八是小时候被捡来的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.00,0:48:25.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来大家是被迫在这里工作
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.87,0:48:28.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 快想想办法呀
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.86,0:48:29.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.23,0:48:31.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知子
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.15,0:48:36.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知子 不要擅自行动啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.70,0:48:37.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.20,0:48:38.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.59,0:48:40.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们从哪进来的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.34,0:48:44.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不是什么可疑份子
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.29,0:48:45.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.86,0:48:51.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我看见了 就得把你们抓起来
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.66,0:48:54.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家快逃呀
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.08,0:48:58.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.06,0:49:03.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 快想办法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.76,0:49:07.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是第6小队 发现入侵者 快来支援
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.69,0:49:12.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.25,0:49:12.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知子
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.88,0:49:13.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达古
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.28,0:49:15.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八也来了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.65,0:49:17.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.74,0:49:21.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 不是 不是
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.99,0:49:24.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了 在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.86,0:49:27.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『地洞圈』
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.87,0:49:37.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们做了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.62,0:49:40.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 有没有什么武器吗
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.86,0:49:44.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么说我都是维护家庭和平
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.47,0:49:47.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以阳光未来为目标啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.23,0:49:48.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.90,0:49:51.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『消光暗灯』
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.91,0:49:54.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真是好帮忙的机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.97,0:49:57.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.09,0:50:01.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家跟在我后面
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.20,0:49:58.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.09,0:50:09.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 你在哪呀
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.99,0:50:05.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖 胖虎 你在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.48,0:50:06.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓到他们了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.05,0:50:10.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边 这边
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.80,0:50:12.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.45,0:50:14.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏 夏咪
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.32,0:50:16.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄拿着
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.74,0:50:17.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.66,0:50:25.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们给我老实点
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.02,0:50:28.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命呀
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.12,0:50:31.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.40,0:50:36.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.37,0:50:37.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危险
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.87,0:50:46.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.02,0:50:55.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你醒了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.13,0:51:00.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.65,0:51:04.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她要是有个三长两短 我不会原谅你的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.04,0:51:07.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个不用你担心
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.88,0:51:12.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要你听我的话就不会有事
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.00,0:51:14.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是猫杰啦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.84,0:51:18.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是猫杰啦游乐园的主人
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.82,0:51:22.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猫杰啦左卫门之丞景虎
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.55,0:51:24.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好长的名字呀
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.52,0:51:28.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在地下制造的是什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.21,0:51:30.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你是记载在...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.76,0:51:35.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑暗默示录里记载机器猫自然会明白的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.73,0:51:38.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然是『时光机』
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.01,0:51:44.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 可以自由穿梭在时间和空间里的方舟
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.13,0:51:45.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拥有不可思议的口袋
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.78,0:51:47.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以拿出不可思议的工具
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.27,0:51:49.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的事情都写在里面
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.54,0:51:51.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是谁写的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.26,0:51:54.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我告诉你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.11,0:51:59.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一千年前 我们猫杰啦族伟大的先祖
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.43,0:52:00.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,落汤猫大人
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.80,0:52:01.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,落汤猫...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.21,0:52:10.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为被雨淋透 就叫落汤猫吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.48,0:52:16.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来是这么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.43,0:52:20.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 造那么大的一个『时光机』要做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.84,0:52:24.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大总统的发表时间到了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.91,0:52:27.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听完了 我再告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.34,0:52:34.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敬爱的猫狗国的各位
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.18,0:52:37.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一个悲惨事实要告诉大家
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.22,0:52:42.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在36小时候后 我们美丽的地球
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.66,0:52:44.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将要面临的是陨石群的撞击
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.06,0:52:47.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.57,0:52:51.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最大的陨石直径有20千米
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.13,0:52:54.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有的动植物将面临死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.11,0:52:56.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地表将会受到大冲击
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.98,0:52:59.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来如此 这个世界
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.08,0:53:04.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在21世纪消失的谜团终于解开了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.46,0:53:07.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 这并不代表绝望了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.68,0:53:12.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们很早就察觉到了这个事实
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.13,0:53:15.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因此早就准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.03,0:53:18.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是离开地球计划
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.50,0:53:20.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个计划是
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.82,0:53:24.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备可以容载全民众
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.33,0:53:28.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离开地球的宇宙船已经完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.78,0:53:32.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放进诺雷珠就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.23,0:53:37.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们移民到的星球是在大犬座的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.66,0:53:41.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,环境和地球很相近
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.11,0:53:46.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离开这个美丽的地球是很心痛
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.61,0:53:48.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望全民众一起同心协力
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.84,0:53:53.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿出勇气一起向新的世界出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.86,0:53:57.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听到了吗 再拖下去就很不妙
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.66,0:54:00.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦和小八到哪里去了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.75,0:54:05.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋 你要干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.39,0:54:09.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好听着 时间方舟已经造好了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.38,0:54:12.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们已经没有利用价值了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.25,0:54:16.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就乖乖地和地球一起灭亡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.29,0:54:18.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什 什么
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.46,0:54:26.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我们一族的目的地 不是宇宙
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.81,0:54:30.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是通过『时光机』去未来
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.58,0:54:32.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,未 未来
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.22,0:54:36.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 就是去征服未来的人类世界
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.03,0:54:39.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让全人类成为我们的宠物
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.14,0:54:42.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宠物 为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.23,0:54:44.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在黑暗默示录里写着
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.78,0:54:47.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一族的先祖 狗和猫
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.45,0:54:51.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是经历了何等的残酷对待
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.36,0:54:58.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类对于宠物 任意的争夺
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.26,0:55:01.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厌烦的时候就作为礼物送走或随便丢弃
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.00,0:55:03.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类是恶魔的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.30,0:55:10.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能再让人类待在这个地球上
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.63,0:55:15.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是猫族的话 就应该帮助我
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.68,0:55:19.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样的事我怎么可能帮你
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.45,0:55:24.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就没办法了 你看看这个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.14,0:55:30.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏 夏咪
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.17,0:55:40.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不同意的话 夏咪会怎么样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.56,0:55:46.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好过份
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.22,0:55:52.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.19,0:56:00.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出发是今天下午 大家冷静跟着行动
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.78,0:56:03.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出发时间是今天下午
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.07,0:56:07.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的计划就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.39,0:56:08.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你欺骗了我们
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.32,0:56:12.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是说只有你们离开吗
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.31,0:56:14.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且是去未来
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.26,0:56:16.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们要把人类怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.80,0:56:26.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎样 机械的猫
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.98,0:56:31.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要我怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.30,0:56:33.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看好了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.60,0:56:40.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.09,0:56:46.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是 『进化退化光线枪』
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.09,0:56:50.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 我要你修好它
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.20,0:56:57.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用这个可以把凶暴的人类退化成原始人
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.14,0:57:00.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,征服起来就简单了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.08,0:57:02.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.16,0:57:07.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你修好这个 就可以救夏咪了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.07,0:57:11.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然这个时速300公里的轨车
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.34,0:57:15.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这样从夏咪的身上开过
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.86,0:57:21.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么能这样
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.40,0:57:24.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.93,0:57:34.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.01,0:57:36.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快停下
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.42,0:57:39.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你修不修理『进化退化光线枪』
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.47,0:57:42.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.15,0:58:05.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个修好 那你也没用了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.86,0:58:06.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼悟
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.90,0:58:07.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.04,0:58:09.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他打成废铁吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.94,0:58:13.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.27,0:58:16.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪 太好了你没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.73,0:58:19.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪 辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.20,0:58:22.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个机器猫还有用
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.52,0:58:27.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果他不听话的话到时再铲除也不迟
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.97,0:58:30.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难不成夏咪你
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.34,0:58:35.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这个难不成
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.85,0:58:38.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把这个机器猫关进『时光机』里去
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.47,0:58:39.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然这样...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.84,0:58:44.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪你竟然是他的同伙
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.10,0:58:46.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.46,0:58:48.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.63,0:58:55.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带下去
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.83,0:58:56.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.82,0:59:04.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样所有的准备都齐了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.91,0:59:07.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼悟 实行B计划
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.45,0:59:08.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.40,0:59:11.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,B计划是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.72,0:59:16.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将政府的诺雷珠搞到手
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.12,0:59:18.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 这么做的话
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.37,0:59:21.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家不就不能离开地球了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.50,0:59:24.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么关系
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.26,0:59:29.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要启动时间方舟是需要庞大的能源的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.80,0:59:30.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么这样
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.30,0:59:34.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪 你也是猫杰啦家族的一份子
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.50,0:59:36.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不许你反抗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.18,1:00:00.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是能源部
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.52,1:00:03.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诺雷珠仓库里有可疑份子进入
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.36,1:00:12.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 喂 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.36,1:00:15.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.41,1:00:18.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诺雷珠被偷了 怎么回事呀
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.71,1:00:21.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像是有人入侵了能源部
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.17,1:00:24.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抢走了脱出用的诺雷珠
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.95,1:00:27.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会这样...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.86,1:00:29.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去追查
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.49,1:00:32.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无论如何都要找回来
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.30,1:00:53.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都到哪去了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.73,1:00:57.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样就要向地球告别了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.19,1:00:58.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是呀
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.88,1:01:01.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得想个办法离开这里
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.89,1:01:06.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快看 是小八
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.95,1:01:13.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果能引开守卫的话
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.31,1:01:17.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 对了 有个好东西
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.04,1:01:17.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.17,1:01:27.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么东西 从什么地方跑进来的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.97,1:01:32.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.34,1:01:34.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八 快趁现在
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.10,1:01:38.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按下那个按钮
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.40,1:01:42.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.57,1:01:44.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.45,1:01:47.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之 先出去再说
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.44,1:01:55.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦在那个东西里
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.12,1:02:05.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 科学家们逃走了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.65,1:02:07.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这就去抓他们
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.93,1:02:11.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用了 让他们去吧 反正不会有什么事的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.45,1:02:17.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在已经万事俱备 马上就要出发了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.18,1:02:25.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.01,1:02:33.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 我们快去把这件事禀报大总统吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.03,1:02:34.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.85,1:02:36.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我留在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.94,1:02:39.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去救哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.88,1:02:42.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能丢下哆啦A梦不管
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.13,1:02:43.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是当然的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.86,1:02:45.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.19,1:02:47.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了 我们也留下
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.79,1:02:50.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.15,1:02:51.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.63,1:02:52.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.18,1:02:55.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈带大家去大总统那吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.99,1:02:58.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了 大家要小心呀
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.77,1:03:00.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家保重
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.06,1:03:01.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.98,1:03:04.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出发吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.24,1:03:12.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.07,1:03:14.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快看上面
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.60,1:03:27.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个就是时间方舟
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.14,1:03:32.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.59,1:03:34.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有什么好办法吗
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.96,1:03:38.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 用挂在那里的那个可以飞过去
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.42,1:03:42.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 一口气冲上去的话
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.62,1:03:46.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以从那个轨道飞到那里
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.39,1:03:48.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这么定了 大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.30,1:04:01.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等用诺雷珠充电完成后 马上就是时候了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.74,1:04:11.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来就拜托你们了 大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.34,1:04:13.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打开开关
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.60,1:04:14.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.97,1:04:17.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 要小心
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.49,1:04:18.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.70,1:04:20.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.16,1:04:28.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.92,1:04:39.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陨石
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.46,1:04:50.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陨石坠落了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.02,1:05:00.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去了 大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.51,1:05:01.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.58,1:05:04.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.96,1:05:05.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.76,1:05:20.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁现在
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.06,1:05:24.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.55,1:05:27.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞起来了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.62,1:05:43.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.51,1:05:49.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像是『时光机』的里面
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.36,1:05:51.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把引擎装置关闭吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.89,1:05:52.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.36,1:05:57.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 我可不允许你们这样做
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.98,1:06:01.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出口在哪呀
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.35,1:06:05.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 你干什么的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.13,1:06:08.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 等等 有了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.20,1:06:11.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,名刀『电光丸』
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.16,1:06:12.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.14,1:06:18.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的剑术怎样
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.00,1:06:25.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过其实是『电光丸』做的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.07,1:06:28.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放心好了 你们只是昏过去而已
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.24,1:06:29.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是什么人
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.16,1:06:31.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 还有啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.34,1:06:37.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是个臭屁的小子
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.93,1:06:48.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有一点点
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.12,1:06:53.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 人类们觉悟吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.42,1:07:04.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,觉悟吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.37,1:07:05.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.66,1:07:06.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.48,1:07:10.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猫杰啦 你的对手是我
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.42,1:07:11.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.72,1:07:13.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里交给我
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.79,1:07:15.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又来搅局吗
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.26,1:07:17.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去卸引擎
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.74,1:07:19.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.77,1:07:23.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心点呀
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.51,1:07:31.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请大家赶快进行紧急避难
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.32,1:07:35.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.41,1:07:45.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 糟了 没电池了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.33,1:07:51.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胜负已分了 小哆啦
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.00,1:08:07.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个好像是引擎
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.77,1:08:13.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了 小八
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.60,1:08:17.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好 我先过去
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.09,1:08:31.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想做什么
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.91,1:08:35.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放手
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.69,1:08:39.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.34,1:08:42.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得快点...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.56,1:08:47.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 是夏咪呀
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.09,1:08:49.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.90,1:08:56.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪 去按下起飞杆 马上起飞
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.81,1:08:58.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要呀 夏咪
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.28,1:08:59.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.45,1:09:00.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点去
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.08,1:09:01.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.14,1:09:05.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.67,1:09:11.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我做不到
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.59,1:09:14.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滚开
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.75,1:09:16.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.41,1:09:19.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真是太过分了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.05,1:09:20.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.39,1:09:21.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快住手
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.07,1:09:24.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.75,1:09:29.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猫杰啦 我真的真的生气了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.77,1:09:45.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你输了 臭猫
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.98,1:09:48.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我输了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.45,1:09:56.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪 为了我 你要振作呀
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.77,1:10:00.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.47,1:10:02.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.50,1:10:15.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停下来了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.75,1:10:18.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害 你怎么办到的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.90,1:10:21.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.90,1:10:36.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,掉下来了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.40,1:10:55.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八 小八
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.36,1:11:09.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.91,1:11:24.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.13,1:11:27.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.20,1:11:34.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-♪-喂 喂 乌龟先生 乌龟先生哟-♪-
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.86,1:11:40.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我保证 明天我一定会来的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.22,1:11:48.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我保证 我一定会来的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.09,1:11:57.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 我为了这个约定一直在等啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.85,1:12:21.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大总统 万岁
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.60,1:12:29.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,久等了 大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.67,1:12:31.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们马上就可以见面了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.75,1:12:36.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.22,1:12:57.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 小一
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.21,1:13:01.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对啊 我就是小一
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.51,1:13:16.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 小八
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.63,1:13:19.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.75,1:13:20.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.98,1:13:24.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行了 两个都不会游泳啊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.45,1:13:26.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么呢
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.38,1:13:30.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.17,1:13:31.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.21,1:13:37.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.22,1:13:41.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们好像还活着
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.40,1:13:46.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.87,1:13:48.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.42,1:13:50.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.77,1:13:58.93,*Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,-♪-喂 喂 乌龟先生 乌龟先生哟-♪-
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.93,1:14:04.08,*Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,-♪-全世界没有比你更慢的了-♪-
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.08,1:14:09.31,*Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,-♪-没有可以束缚你的东西-♪-
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.31,1:14:13.53,*Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,-♪-然而你为何如此缓慢-♪-
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.46,1:13:58.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁在唱歌
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.10,1:14:01.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奶奶？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.34,1:14:10.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 这个声音应该是...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.53,1:14:22.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.74,1:14:27.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.82,1:14:32.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,438)\fs25}大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.82,1:14:32.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 小一
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.88,1:14:34.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.85,1:14:38.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 我相信你一定会回来的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.33,1:14:42.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 你果然是小一啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.49,1:14:44.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.77,1:14:49.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个你一直带着啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.16,1:14:58.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.83,1:14:59.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.92,1:15:05.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 但是能实现这个约定太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.02,1:15:09.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄总算等到了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.12,1:15:13.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是对方怎么从一千年前...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.08,1:15:17.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,思念的心情创造了奇迹
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.02,1:15:18.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太感人了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.00,1:15:22.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.18,1:15:24.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.22,1:15:27.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八 诺雷珠落在水里了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.20,1:15:29.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说来...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.42,1:15:35.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诺雷珠碰到水就不能用了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.90,1:15:39.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样的话 脱出用的宇宙船就不能启动了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.90,1:15:41.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么办
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.08,1:15:43.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 不能想想办法吗
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.78,1:15:46.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.88,1:15:48.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.78,1:15:50.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神啊
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.82,1:15:55.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄是神？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.59,1:16:00.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 我想起来了 大家不要担心
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.00,1:16:04.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们先去机场
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.23,1:16:24.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像神社的暗室一样
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.52,1:16:31.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 这就是创造我们国家的神
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.70,1:16:32.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.43,1:16:44.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的是大雄呀
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.32,1:16:56.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 那诺雷珠在哪
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.60,1:17:03.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这里 这个大雄像全部都是用诺雷珠做的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.57,1:17:05.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.35,1:17:07.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从头到脚都是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.91,1:17:08.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害呀
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.93,1:17:12.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没时间了 大家快点
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.90,1:17:26.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是危险啊
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.90,1:17:28.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没到吗
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.54,1:17:30.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要加速了 大家抓紧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.09,1:17:44.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类啊 现在给我掉入黑暗中吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.67,1:17:46.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猫杰啦
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.19,1:17:53.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干掉你们
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.19,1:18:12.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.02,1:18:17.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.21,1:18:19.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系 我拉着
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.06,1:18:23.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上就让你自由
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.25,1:18:29.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是隧道 得救了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.01,1:18:30.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还在追
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.69,1:18:41.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.83,1:18:47.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.68,1:18:49.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.51,1:18:54.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手不能松开 不能掏道具了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.14,1:18:59.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 我们没关系的 你们快走
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.19,1:19:01.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可以
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.25,1:19:14.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 我帮你拿道具
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.13,1:19:17.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.74,1:19:22.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.93,1:19:25.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓到了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.02,1:19:27.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后面
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.54,1:19:36.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.64,1:19:41.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这下有趣了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.17,1:19:44.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.17,1:19:46.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快想想办法
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.18,1:19:53.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 拿着那个剑玉
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.57,1:19:55.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.11,1:19:58.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,方向盘拜托了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.52,1:20:00.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.79,1:20:04.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃我下一招
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.69,1:20:08.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 用剑玉直接瞄准他的头部
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.17,1:20:09.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.43,1:20:12.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了 FULL POWER
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.06,1:20:21.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 要去了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.56,1:20:22.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.96,1:20:29.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-♪-喂 喂 乌龟先生 乌龟先生...哟-♪-
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.53,1:20:30.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一群笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.55,1:20:33.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『放大灯』
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.59,1:21:07.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家快点
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.86,1:21:39.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全员都上去了 随时都可以出发
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.97,1:21:45.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『时光机』也修好了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.94,1:21:52.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是帮了很多忙 我代表民众们万分感谢
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.63,1:21:54.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.14,1:21:59.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 这次真的要分手了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.69,1:22:04.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 和我们一起回21世纪 好吗
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.35,1:22:06.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个不行
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.33,1:22:12.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有责任和大家一起到新的地球上建立新的国家
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.99,1:22:16.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个别人也可以做的啊
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.32,1:22:21.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 不要再为难他了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.79,1:22:27.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像小一这样进化的人型狗不可以带到21世纪的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.73,1:22:29.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如哆啦A梦所说的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.92,1:22:33.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不可以去改变人类的历史
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.51,1:22:35.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 但是...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.44,1:22:42.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了 小一
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.65,1:22:44.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.17,1:22:46.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.52,1:22:47.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.12,1:22:48.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达古 太郎
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.04,1:22:50.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,438)\fs25}再见了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.58,1:22:51.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见 我不会忘了你的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.86,1:22:53.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.37,1:22:58.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保重呀 知子
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.77,1:23:02.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达古 不要感冒哦
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.98,1:23:06.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫才是 不要再只穿内衣外出呀
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.15,1:23:08.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太郎
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.37,1:23:10.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.39,1:23:16.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要出发了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.34,1:23:19.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见 大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.52,1:23:19.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,438)\fs25}再见了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.38,1:23:21.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见 小一
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.13,1:23:23.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见 大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.94,1:23:28.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.35,1:23:29.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.56,1:23:35.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 大家保重
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.73,1:23:54.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.63,1:23:59.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见 小一
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.16,1:24:07.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢 小一
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.69,1:24:14.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-♪-喂 喂 乌龟先生 乌龟先生哟-♪-
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.15,1:24:19.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-♪-全世界没有比你更慢的了-♪-
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.59,1:24:24.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-♪-没有可以束缚你的东西-♪-
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.87,1:24:29.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-♪-然而你为何如此缓慢-♪-
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.55,1:25:07.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球在46亿年间有多少事在重复着
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.81,1:25:13.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诞生之后消亡 马上又会有新的生命诞生
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.29,1:25:16.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也一样呢
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.53,1:25:20.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有爷爷奶奶 也有爸爸妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.63,1:25:27.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们将来也会变成爸爸妈妈、爷爷奶奶
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.90,1:25:28.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.91,1:25:32.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许说不定什么时候 我们的子孙
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.92,1:25:36.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和小一的子孙会在宇宙的某个地方相遇
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.12,1:25:38.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定的
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.25,1:25:40.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对吧 小一
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.41,1:29:00.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(566,450)\fs18}HKG & LLOUP 制作于2006 冬 [圣诞]
